  "evidence_rule": "No backend is marked PASS on source-only contract tests, host models, parser acceptance, stale/other backend receipts, or zero executed CI steps. Require exact compiler/tree SHA, actual compiled .atto guest, input/output/exit witnesses, negative codegen refusal, carrier liveness/security evidence, and runnable target receipt. The two checked-read spellings must produce equivalent typed guest behavior. Nested Ok/Option matching is separate; no implicit unwrap. Verify checked nominal is-ADT syntax and its legacy parentheses aliases are parse/type/IR-equivalent, with negative invalid extractors, wrong families/arity, duplicate arms, and actual guest execution before status changes."
